{"version":1,"content":"<p>知名瀏覽器開發商The Browser Company宣佈，將於2026年12月22日正式停止Arc瀏覽器服務。這款以創新界面和獨特生產力功能聞名的瀏覽器即將結束使命，公司未來將把全部重點轉向人工智能瀏覽器Dia。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583436.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:59:37.597647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:55:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.642616+00:00","content_hash":"7a4177e16b5f7da228517e89d95a39d4abc9adba428570b871b175c9fb9c593e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}